-- 12: a provenance DEFAULT that gives NULL for the writing role is refused with the column and role named
ERROR:  sql_saga: provenance column "edit_by" of "pv_161.lu": its DEFAULT gave NULL for the writing role pv_161_user
HINT:  The DEFAULT must name the writer for every role that writes this table.
