-- 13b: a provenance trigger left disabled is reported by check_integrity
ERROR:  sql_saga: integrity violation for era "valid" on table "pv_161.lu": provenance trigger valid_provenance is disabled; repair with ALTER TABLE pv_161.lu ENABLE TRIGGER valid_provenance
-- 9: registration refusals
ERROR:  sql_saga: provenance column "note" of table "pv_161.lu" has no DEFAULT
HINT:  sql_saga fills a provenance column from its DEFAULT on every write. Give it one, e.g. ALTER TABLE pv_161.lu ALTER COLUMN note SET DEFAULT ...
ERROR:  sql_saga: column "edit_by" of table "pv_161.lu" is listed both as ephemeral and as provenance
HINT:  A provenance column is already excluded from change detection; list it in one list only.
